  "description": {
   "en": "Hina, a high school girl who wants to become a doctor, travels back in time to the Heian period during a school excursion! There, she is asked to take the place of Minamoto no Yoshitsune, her only emotional support is Taira no Koremori, a member of the Taira clan, which is hostile to the Minamoto clan!",
   "ja": "医者を目指す女子高生のヒナは、修学旅行中に平安時代にタイムスリップしてしまう！　そこで源義経に成り代わることを頼まれてしまって！？　彼女の唯一の心の拠り所は、源氏と敵対している平氏の平維盛だった――！"
  },
